    {
      "id": "step-004",
      "title": "Ask Allow：真实origin接收method/query/header/body；结果遮罩凭据并且不进入Capture。 / Ask Allow: the real origin receives method/query/header/body; the result redacts credentials and never enters Capture.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-004.png",
      "rawImage": "step-004.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-005",
      "title": "Auto TLS：成功探测只握手不发应用数据；未监听端口返回稳定失败结果。 / Auto TLS: a successful probe performs only a handshake; a closed port returns a stable failure result.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-005.png",
      "rawImage": "step-005.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-006",
      "title": "Stop：真实origin已收到请求但暂缓响应；停止Turn必须立即关闭socket且不发起下一次Model Call。 / Stop: the real origin has received a held request; stopping the Turn must close the socket and skip the next Model Call.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-006.png",
      "rawImage": "step-006.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-007",
      "title": "Settings撤权：关闭全部六项后discovery为空，旧网络调用均unknown_tool且网络计数不变。 / Settings revocation: disabling all six empties discovery; previous network calls are unknown and network counts stay unchanged.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "image": "step-007.png",
      "rawImage": "step-007.png"
